        { type: 'p', text: "The term health has come to have a wider meaning than it used to. It no longer means just the absence of illness. Health is now used to refer to the well-being of your body, your mind, and your relationships with other people. These types of well-being are called physical health, mental health, and social health, and the concept of health that includes all three is called wellness." }
