        { type: 'p', text: "Think about the last time you were coming down with the flu: a runny nose or general tiredness, then worse symptoms and a fever, then several days later feeling more energetic again, then finally feeling great. You moved along a sequence from wellness to illness and back — a continuum, a progression in either direction from one stage to another." }
