        { type: 'p', text: "To achieve a better quality of life, you need to know about, choose, and practice behaviors that promote wellness — and be aware of your own particular conditions and needs. Awareness is the first step toward healthful choices, acquiring knowledge is the second, and applying that awareness and knowledge by taking action is the last." }
