        { type: 'p', text: "Knowledge about health is growing every day, but not every new discovery applies to your life, and some sources of health information are far more reliable than others — a scholarly study of weight loss, say, versus an advertisement for a quick-fix diet. Staying informed is a responsibility you'll need to keep up throughout your life." }
